{"id":107,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يُكَذِّبُ بِٱلدِّينِ","transliteration":"Ara-ayta alladhī yukadhibu bil-dīn","translation":"Have you seen the one who denies the ˹final˺ Judgment"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"فَذَٰلِكَ ٱلَّذِى يَدُعُّ ٱلْيَتِيمَ","transliteration":"Fadhālika alladhī yaduʿʿu l-yatīm","translation":"That is the one who repulses the orphan"},{"number":3,"arabicText":"وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلْمِسْكِينِ","transliteration":"Walā yaḥuḍḍu ʿalā ṭaʿāmi l-mis'kīn","translation":"and does not encourage the feeding of the poor"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"فَوَيْلٌۭ لِّلْمُصَلِّينَ","transliteration":"Fawaylul-lil'muṣallīn","translation":"So woe to those ˹hypocrites˺ who pray"},{"number":5,"arabicText":"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ عَن صَلَاتِهِمْ سَاهُونَ","transliteration":"Alladhīna hum ʿan ṣalātihim sāhūn","translation":"yet are unmindful of their prayers"},{"number":6,"arabicText":"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ يُرَآءُونَ","transliteration":"Alladhīna hum yurāūn","translation":"those who ˹only˺ show off"},{"number":7,"arabicText":"وَيَمْنَعُونَ ٱلْمَاعُونَ","transliteration":"Wayamnaʿūna l-māʿūn","translation":"and refuse to give ˹even the simplest˺ aid"}]}